  "sourceText": "Iceberg Lettuce Salad\nBy: Lady Catherine ...\nPublished: Tuesday, April 30, 2013 - 11:06am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 head of ice berg lettuce – quartered\n2 Kirby cucumbers – quartered\nHandful of radishes – sliced\n1 red onion – sliced\nFresh grated Romano cheese\nDressing:\nJuice of 1 lemon\n¼ tsp. salt\n¼ tsp. black pepper\n2 tablespoons of olive oil\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Quarter the lettuce and arrange on a platter.  Add the cucumber, radishes, onions and grated cheese.  Finish with the dressing.",
